# Zoo Flow Overview

This workspace runs **Zoo Flow** automatically (see [AGENTS.md](AGENTS.md)). No slash commands.

## Auto-routing

1. Read the user's request
2. Infer the lightest safe workflow (see `zoo-routing.mdc`, `zoo-auto-invocation.mdc`)
3. Load the matching skill from `.cursor/skills/zoo-{name}/`
4. Adopt the right role and execute immediately

## Roles (adopted automatically per phase)

1. **System Architect** — plan, diagnose, explore, review. Edit only `*.md`, `.scratch/**`, `docs/**`.
2. **Code Tweaker** — implement, test, verify, prototype. Full repo. Auto-critic before completing.

Multi-phase workflows switch roles automatically (e.g. diagnose → implement → verify).

## Intent → workflow

| Intent | Auto-load skill |
|--------|-----------------|
| Unknown code area | `zoo-explore` |
| Broken behavior | `zoo-diagnosing-bugs` |
| New capability | `zoo-grill-with-docs` → `zoo-to-spec` |
| Bad structure | `zoo-improve-codebase-architecture` |
| Small known fix | `zoo-tweak` |
| Tests first | `zoo-tdd` |
| Verify change | `zoo-verify` |

## Completion format

Before ending: what was done, files changed, commands/tests (pass/fail), status, remaining risk, next step if any.
